### Production Considerations
- **Cache Invalidation**: Implement proper invalidation strategies to prevent stale data
- **Memory Management**: Monitor cache memory usage and implement eviction policies
- **Distributed Systems**: Use Redis for shared cache across multiple instances
- **Cache-Aside vs Write-Through**: Choose appropriate strategy based on use case
- **Monitoring**: Track hit rates, memory usage, and performance metrics

### Anti-Patterns to Avoid
- ❌ No cache invalidation (leads to stale data)
- ❌ Caching sensitive data without encryption
- ❌ Infinite cache TTL (memory leaks)
- ❌ No fallback when cache fails
- ❌ Caching computationally cheap operations

